<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-23T22:26:01.508Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:26:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese militia boats continue to expand battlefield preparation in the western Pacific, while the Chinese coast guard monitors Philippine resupply missions to the grounded warship at the contested shoal and shadows a U.S. warship nearby. The Philippines rescued four people on Hagonoy Island and its coast guard opened an upgraded station on Pag-asa Island, but coast guard personnel were killed and another wounded in a shooting in Cotabato City. Taiwan has expressed openness to cooperate with the Philippines on undersea cable protection and the Philippines is exploring deeper cooperation with Taiwan on this issue. An ex-NSA urged activation of the Philippines-China coast guard agreement. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1aaDFZc0NKU3IxaExETnFoVVJ4NFF5NW9YUG96bTYzeGowOUEyNk5EWjg1Z0dpcjdQc3o5bGdiaUxMRmRVLTB1a1Bmek94amlQcFZyZC1pbHE1VEJ0ODFHM0VCbzR2bnlKUklIY20wTUtxcDduTGdEamdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taipei Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOYTBSalU3ZGU0TU9nQnktTlAzdUstd2tBLWlCLTZ1dWJKUFBTYWZsZTB3TGxsVVlCRUMxTXIxckhDMk90TnVEb0xEZGN5ZThULW1heWFDT0hYdDRWSzNfZzFxU3NhSDd2UFZhRXZ0WWFXS3pXTkhscnpLb05CNDl0aDc1Mkl3SHZFeGFXNFB2em5QUUY5OE1Obm4tNE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQV3hGbHVkdzlvRmNzS1pNS1czSkFRaVNfM1NVTGhrV3g3LWxQN3F2dVp6RVI3bXJuQklSUVVZdWxEMWh5Sl91QlF3dzJZSXMzWUVoa1pBcUZlMTN5b1FtdXBuZm42cGhhTEFsVklvLTYwc3FMU0gxbEFwM0hvVzlQTG9VdTJpQXlJY3F4SGZFbEV5VUdsajY1OGdKUnlITERUNXozYVR3YlFYWGdi